  "title": "HB 2020 (2025-2026 biennium (2025 Regular Session)): HB 2020 Requiring a quarterly report from the director of the division of vehicles listing the names, addresses and alien registration numbers of certain noncitizens who have been issued a driver's license during such quarter.",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.kslegislature.gov/b2025_26/bills/HB2020/",
