  "version": "enrolled",
  "operative_text": "(a_in_person_id) not stated.\n(b_no_id_remedy) not stated.\n(c_mail_ballot_id) not stated.\n(d_proof_of_citizenship)\n(section) New Sec. 1 / K.S.A. 25-2324-style text: reinstatement on proof of citizenship\n(quote) The county election officer shall notify any person removed from the voter registration rolls that the person may be reinstated on the voter registration rolls by providing proof of\n(e_other_rule) not stated.\n(other) Driver-licence division must send quarterly list of licences issued to noncitizens to the secretary of state; secretary of state compares it with voter rolls and has the county election officer remove noncitizens (amends K.S.A. 8-240).",
